        "TileImage": "$($repository 52cfd5fd-b9b9-454a-8c7c-8a218501d3b4).Image",
        "Description": "Graf Gustaf Feldschlacht IV is well-known for being a bit too much into fencing and swordsmanship. During one of his visits on Sgail for an Ark Society meeting, a guard made a lot of misplaced jokes about his passion, saying that &quot;swords are completely outdated now that we have guns&quot; in particular. \r\rHe wants us to show this foul-mouthed guard that you don&apos;t bring a gun to a sword fight. Although you might actually have to bring one just in case.",
